# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按平台转换。
# 避免 Windows 上编辑过的 Go 源码被提交成 CRLF，导致 diff 噪音与 CI 报错。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制文件，禁止任何换行符转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 可能无法正确解析
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 用于 GitHub 语言统计：把前端标记为 TS/TSX，而不是把整个仓库算成 Go
*.ts   linguist-language=TypeScript
*.tsx  linguist-language=TypeScript

# 文档与锁文件默认折叠进 diff
README.md       linguist-documentation
docs/*          linguist-documentation
frontend/package-lock.json  linguist-generated
